scn 1
# Slow turners: the retail roster's slow half (53 of 125 ground movers turn at or
# below 1000 BAM/tick) with turn-in-place 0, so they can only turn while they move.
# Four regions stacked in one 220x620 map, one group of 48 footprint-2 bodies in each:
#   z   0-169  ragged corner (corner-1x48's geometry), turn 400
#   z 170-339  ragged corner, turn 1000
#   z 340-479  U-turn round a wall's top (uturn's geometry, block at x 44), turn 400
#   z 480-619  U-turn, turn 1000
# A 1-cell wall closes each region's bottom. Orders are two ticks apart so each
# selection (48 commands) lands in one tick. Read per-group g.<name>.* for
# progress and gate.<name>.* for the files over the obstacle. Fast comparison:
# corner-1x48.scn and wall-1x48.scn are the same shapes at turn 2500.
# Speed 1.79999 builds the raw 117964 speed (1.8 rounds to 117965).
name slowturn
ticks 6000
seed 7
map flat 220 620
type s400 mover 2 400 10 1.79999 turninplace=0
type s1000 mover 2 1000 10 1.79999 turninplace=0
wall 80 60 40 110
wall 150 0 4 78
wall 81 58 1 1
wall 86 57 1 1
wall 91 59 1 1
wall 96 58 1 1
wall 101 57 1 1
wall 106 59 1 1
wall 111 58 1 1
wall 116 57 1 1
wall 78 59 1 1
wall 79 57 1 1
wall 77 61 1 1
wall 76 64 1 1
wall 79 66 1 1
wall 78 73 1 1
wall 77 80 1 1
wall 79 87 1 1
wall 78 94 1 1
wall 77 101 1 1
wall 79 108 1 1
wall 78 115 1 1
wall 77 122 1 1
wall 79 129 1 1
wall 78 136 1 1
wall 77 143 1 1
wall 79 150 1 1
wall 78 157 1 1
wall 0 169 220 1
wall 80 230 40 110
wall 150 170 4 78
wall 81 228 1 1
wall 86 227 1 1
wall 91 229 1 1
wall 96 228 1 1
wall 101 227 1 1
wall 106 229 1 1
wall 111 228 1 1
wall 116 227 1 1
wall 78 229 1 1
wall 79 227 1 1
