wall 79 299 1 1
wall 78 306 1 1
wall 77 313 1 1
wall 79 320 1 1
wall 78 327 1 1
wall 0 339 220 1
wall 98 388 4 91
wall 0 479 220 1
wall 98 528 4 91
wall 0 619 220 1
group C400 0 s400 48 rect 14 104 38 122 pitch=3
group C1000 0 s1000 48 rect 14 274 38 292 pitch=3
group W400 0 s400 48 rect 44 435 68 453 pitch=3
group W1000 0 s1000 48 rect 44 575 68 593 pitch=3
